%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">11</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">조에 의한 법정단체로서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">지식재산 전문자격사인 변리사와 함께 국내외 특허</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">상표 등의 지식재산권</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(IP) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">관리직무를 수행할 인력 양성을 위해 교육과영 운영 및 취업을 지원하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%; text-indent: 3.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%; text-indent: 3.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">본회 회원사인 특허법인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">특허법률사무소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">의 우수인재 채용을 위해 </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">IP </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">관리직무 채용박람회</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">를 개최하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">채용확정자 대상 관련 직무교육을 무료로 제공하오니 취업에 관심 있는 학생이 참여할 수 있도록 홍보 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%; text-indent: 3.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">일 시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: 2022</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">01</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">25</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">), 14:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">장 소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">대한변리사회관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">서울시 서초구 명달로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">107)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:11.0pt;\">참가신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 180%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">     </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2022</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-fam